  "contentHtml": "<p>재과만 문항 생성기 잘 활용하고 계시죠?</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에는</p><p>김정식&amp;김영학</p><p>&amp; &#39;경기중등수석교사회&#39; 의 콜라보로 완성한</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#39;모든 교과 문항 생성기&#39;를 공유합니다!</p><p><a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/share/46b0bfd08dcb\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://gemini.google.com/share/46b0bfd08dcb</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>모든 교과에서 사용할 수 있습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그리고</p><p>생성기에&#160;</p><p>기출 문항이 아닌,</p><p>&#160;</p><p>내가 출제하고 싶은 그림만 한장 넣고, 원하는 문항을 설명했습니다.&#160;</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/17e93f78387cd985cc961a2c856fd3ab624903ab\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"299\" height=\"402\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/17e93f78387cd985cc961a2c856fd3ab624903ab\" data-origin-width=\"444\" data-origin-height=\"597\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0d5f8558186fbe97468a28ea36bd9b07c03002ec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0d5f8558186fbe97468a28ea36bd9b07c03002ec\" data-origin-width=\"345\" data-origin-height=\"194\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>결과는!!!</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14033a69e04416b90566ca3660e3554fb2feb4d5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"514\" height=\"489\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14033a69e04416b90566ca3660e3554fb2feb4d5\" data-origin-width=\"723\" data-origin-height=\"688\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type